  "single-target burst": "單體爆發",
  "Every spell seals another Chamber, and Orryn grows heavier through the whole fight. Pressure Sphere Crushes its target, and three Crushed stacks pin it in place. Abyssal Reserve can be saved for Pressure Sphere or turned into a stun; the signature opens the chamber with no far wall.": "每次施法封存一間密室，使奧林在戰鬥中越來越沉重。壓力球碾壓目標，三層碾壓會將其定住。深淵儲備可留給壓力球或轉為暈眩。招牌天賦開啟沒有遠端牆壁的密室。",
  "Spiral Current winds Whorls into everything it passes until they are spun round. The energy his current steals is Drawn Strength, handed to the ally who needs it. Spiral Current can carry enemies or stand and spin; the signature turns his ult into a spiral that drains all energy.": "螺旋海流經過敵人時累積漩渦，直至使敵人旋轉。竊取的能量會交給需要它的盟友。水流可以捲走敵人或原地旋轉。招牌天賦將終極技能化作汲取能量的旋流。",
  "zone": "區域控制",
